OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrested over violent
OL,4,A#1m home burglary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree more people have been arrested as
OL,7,Fpart of an investigation into a violent
OL,8,F#1m burglary.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said a man was
OL,11,Fhit with a sledgehammer and his wife
OL,12,Fdragged upstairs after five masked men
OL,13,Fbroke into a property off Knowle Lane
OL,14,Fin Kimberley on 4 December 2025.
OL,16,FDetectives said eight suspects, who
OL,17,Fwere arrested between February and June
OL,18,Fthis year on suspicion of a range of
OL,19,Foffences, remain on conditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
