OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrested over violent
OL,4,A#1m home burglary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men, aged 29, 30 and 37, were
OL,7,Farrested on Tuesday morning after
OL,8,Fpolice teams executed warrants at two
OL,9,Fproperties in Leicester.
